						<initial/>
						<documentation value="A category I, II or III holding position sign shall be located on each side of the runway-holding position marking facing the direction of the approach to the critical area.  The inscription on a category I, II, III, joint II/III or joint I/II/III holding position sign shall consist of the runway designator followed by CAT I, CAT II, CAT III, CAT II/III or CAT I/II/III, as appropriate. Source: ICAO Annex 14 p 5.4.2.15.  Note FAA sign has ILS instead of CAT."/>
						<model ea_localid="16" ea_guid="{D84226F4-75AC-4c67-9D3E-BD6C92196E7C}"/>
