						<initial/>
						<documentation value="Air Route Surveillance Radar system.&#xA;&#xA;Air Route Surveillance Radar (ARSR) or Route Surveillance Radar (RSR) is a system of remotely located, long-range radars that primarily provides a display of aircraft locations over large areas to air route traffic control centres"/>
