				<properties documentation="A physical or political border. In general, it will be the border between two countries or States but could also be a coastline, the description of the bank of an important river, or any other geographical shape which can be named and used to describe the border of an airspace. If two countries/States have more than one common border, each one will be an occurrence of this entity.&#xA;" isSpecification="false" sType="Class" nType="0" alias="urn:aero:aixm:GeoBorder:5.2" scope="public" stereotype="feature" isRoot="false" isLeaf="false" isAbstract="false" isActive="false"/>
